WEBVTT

00:10:00.679 --> 00:10:03.015
On August 1,

00:10:03.057 --> 00:10:05.684
we were bringing
our students back to Kabul

00:10:05.684 --> 00:10:07.519
after their semester break.

00:10:08.312 --> 00:10:10.814
On August 15,

00:10:10.814 --> 00:10:13.901
the Taliban were in Kabul and in control.

00:10:15.361 --> 00:10:18.155
And on August 30,

00:10:18.197 --> 00:10:23.285
we were holding our second day of classes
at our new campus in Rwanda

00:10:23.327 --> 00:10:26.372
with our entire community
together and safe.

00:10:27.373 --> 00:10:34.296
(Applause)